Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.96,0:00:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I have been so stiff lately!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.63,0:00:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, shall I give you a massage?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.01,0:00:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you can do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.31,0:00:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's it! That feels sooo good!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.23,0:00:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Soothing my master is\Nmy basic design concept.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.31,0:00:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I am of course capable of\Nerotic massage as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.58,0:00:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,but to unlock that functionality,\Nmaster registration needs to—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.65,0:00:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.28,0:00:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I really not good enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.41,0:00:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.62,0:00:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you hate me, master?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.83,0:00:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's busting out the tears!\NI have to stand my ground!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.42,0:00:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a matter of liking you or not.\NYou're just too human, Nadeshiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.63,0:00:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, requiring master registration\Nmakes me your owner, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.55,0:01:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't treat someone who looks\Njust like a human girl like some object.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.48,0:01:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But then how am I supposed to serve you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.02,0:01:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Saying you seem human is a compliment!\NI don't see you as useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.09,0:01:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.28,0:01:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Sex is something humans\Ndo with other humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.36,0:01:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Master...!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.37,0:01:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't really know\Nmuch about love or sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.04,0:01:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never dated anyone or\Nbeen in a physical relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.46,0:01:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never done anything\Nmore than hold hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.05,0:01:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But anyway! The point is that\Nwe need to start out as friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.26,0:01:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to be my friend, master?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.64,0:01:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't call me "master."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.76,0:01:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- Then what do I call you?\N- Oh. Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.64,0:01:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,My...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.64,0:01:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.19,0:01:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Akane...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.11,0:01:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Akane...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.90,0:01:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,May I kiss you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.40,0:01:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did that come from?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.36,0:02:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Trying without permission made\Nyou angry before, so I thought I'd ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.74,0:02:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't quite get it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.87,0:02:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I mean, I kiss her every morning...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.76,0:02:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Akane...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.01,0:02:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you, Akane.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.89,0:02:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I knew it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.77,0:02:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't say no.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.44,0:02:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Akane...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.36,0:02:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Akane...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.52,0:02:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Akane... Akane...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.28,0:02:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you, Akane.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.45,0:02:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Having her whisper my name...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.30,0:02:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}it's like she's my girlfriend.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.11,0:03:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you please help\Nmake me feel good, now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.08,0:03:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Nadeshiko...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.46,0:03:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're trying to get me to complete\Nmaster registration, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.38,0:03:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Aha! You are! I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.30,0:03:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let me guard down with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.42,0:03:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I just... I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.80,0:03:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you mad at me, Akane?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.81,0:03:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you feel pain, Nadeshiko?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.18,0:03:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sort of. Similar to how humans can.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.73,0:03:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.90,0:03:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\a6}{\i1}Well I'd feel terrible causing you pain.\NI'm glad I wasn't too rough on you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.69,0:04:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd love to do more sometime, Akane!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.53,0:04:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Having her call me\Nby name is sweet agony.{\i0}
